  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "18BBF8C142F9FD38",
      "text": "Hola, claseee. ¿Listos para seguir aprendiendo?\\n¡Seguro que sí![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "18BBFBC142FA0251",
      "text": "Espero que no os hayáis olvidado de la anterior\\ne importante lección dedicada a los Huevos.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "18BBFAC142FA009E",
      "text": "Lo que nos lleva a la siguiente pregunta...\\n¿Habéis probado a usar la Pokédex?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "18BBFDC142FA05B7",
      "text": "En ella quedarán registrados los Pokémon que\\nnazcan de los Huevos, ¡podéis estar tranquilos![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "18BBFCC142FA0404",
      "text": "No sé si lo sabéis, pero yo mismo desarrollé\\nla aplicación, je.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "18BBFFC142FA091D",
      "text": "Aunque eso fue hace mucho pero que mucho\\ntiempo, antes de dar clase aquí.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "18BBFEC142FA076A",
      "text": "Antes era investigador, aquí donde me veis.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "18BBF1C142F9F153",
      "text": "De hecho, incluso el director Clavel trabajaba\\nconmigo en el mismo laboratorio. No formaba\\r\\naún parte del personal docente de la academia.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "18BBF0C142F9EFA0",
      "text": "Me lo pasaba de fábula investigando Pokémon\\ncon él día tras día. Qué buenos recuerdos...\\c\\nAunque también me caían broncas seguido.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_10",
      "hash64": "18B873C142F6E562",
      "text": "Perdonad, que me voy por las ramas. ¿De qué\\nestaba hablando? Ah, sí, de la Pokédex.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_11",
      "hash64": "18B874C142F6E715",
      "text": "Hoy os voy a enseñar a atrapar Pokémon,\\nun pilar de vuestros estudios.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_12",
      "hash64": "18B871C142F6E1FC",
      "text": "Como ya sabréis, antes de atrapar un Pokémon\\ntenéis que disminuir sus PS.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_13",
      "hash64": "18B872C142F6E3AF",
      "text": "Pero existe otra técnica que podéis emplear en\\ncombate para capturar Pokémon con facilidad.\\c\\n¿Alguien sabría decirme cuál es?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_a_03_select_01",
      "hash64": "288E982D51062E98",
      "text": "Darles una baya",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_a_03_select_02",
      "hash64": "288E9B2D510633B1",
      "text": "Infligirles un problema de estado",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_a_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "288E9A2D510631FE",
      "text": "Mostrarles quién es más fuerte",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_answer_01",
      "hash64": "57B2167AC5FF2F01",
      "text": "Qué curioso... No sé si ese truco funcionará en\\notras regiones, pero en Paldea me temo que no.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_answer_02",
      "hash64": "57B2137AC5FF29E8",
      "text": "¡Exacto! Eres muy aplicad[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_answer_03",
      "hash64": "57B2147AC5FF2B9B",
      "text": "Pero bueno, [VAR 0x0100(0000)], vaya cosas tienes.\\c\\nNo te negaré que sacar un Pokémon fuerte a\\ncombatir sea buena idea, de todas formas.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_14",
      "hash64": "18B86FC142F6DE96",
      "text": "La técnica que debéis usar para que os sea\\nmás fácil atrapar un Pokémon es infligirle un\\r\\nproblema de estado.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_15",
      "hash64": "18B870C142F6E049",
      "text": "Por ejemplo, las probabilidades aumentarán\\nconsiderablemente si lográis dormirlo.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_16",
      "hash64": "18B86DC142F6DB30",
      "text": "Para rellenar un montón de entradas en la\\nPokédex, os aconsejo emplear movimientos\\r\\ncomo Somnífero o Hipnosis.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_17",
      "hash64": "18B86EC142F6DCE3",
      "text": "Y no olvidéis que hay otras formas de aumentar\\nlas probabilidades de captura: una de ellas sería\\r\\nutilizar Poké Balls concretas.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_18",
      "hash64": "18B87BC142F6F2FA",
      "text": "Otros ejemplos son comer algo que te otorgue\\nel Poder Captura o sorprender a los Pokémon\\r\\npor la espalda para iniciar el combate.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_19",
      "hash64": "18B87CC142F6F4AD",
      "text": "Si tenéis problemas para capturarlos, pasaos por\\nlos gimnasios y conseguid Medallas de Gimnasio.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_20",
      "hash64": "18B4EDC142F3CBD9",
      "text": "Es importante no dejar de lado esa tarea, pues\\nos permitirá capturar Pokémon de mayor nivel\\r\\nmás fácilmente.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_21",
      "hash64": "18B4ECC142F3CA26",
      "text": "Venid a mostrarme vuestras Pokédex a medida\\nque las completéis, que me hará ilusión.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_22",
      "hash64": "18B4EBC142F3C873",
      "text": "Qué clase tan divertida, ¿a que sí? Pero no\\nolvidéis que el próximo día os toca examen.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
